new file mode 100644
index 000000000..4d848ab4b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-platform-acer-wmi
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/kbd_backlight_timeout
+Date:		October 2026
+KernelVersion:	7.4
+Contact:	platform-driver-x86@vger.kernel.org
+Description:
+		Idle time in seconds after which the firmware turns off the
+		keyboard backlight. Accepts decimal values from 0 to 255;
+		0 means the backlight is never turned off when idle. The
+		setting applies to the whole keyboard backlight. Writing it
+		leaves the keyboard brightness unchanged. Reading returns the
+		value currently held by the firmware.
+
